<title>THAILAND: Thai March foreign reserves steady at US$38.1 bln.</title>
<headline>Thai March foreign reserves steady at US$38.1 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's foreign reserves were steady at US$38.1 billion in March, the same as February, the Bank of Thailand said on Thursday.</p>
<p>    THAI FOREIGN RESERVES    March 97     Feb 97    March 96</p>
<p>					38.1	   38.1	 39.0</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in billions of U.S. dollars.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
